# Extra jpackage options for Windows, passed as @packaging/windows/jpackage.args.
#
# Without these the MSI installed into Program Files and created nothing to start it from.
--win-menu
--win-shortcut
--win-dir-chooser
# The "About" link Settings → Apps shows for the installed MSI. Must equal modula.homepage in the
# pom (PackagingTest).
--about-url
https://github.com/adriandeleon/Modula
